500
00:27:44,705 --> 00:27:49,963
Once it does that, it enters a period of exhaustion and will likely take a break.

501
00:27:49,963 --> 00:27:55,222
So we either look for an unwind of the delta or an extension of the low.

502
00:27:55,225 --> 00:27:57,026
Okay. And that's pretty much

503
00:27:57,026 --> 00:27:59,548
how the trade strategy works. That's the

504
00:27:59,548 --> 00:28:01,710
basic premise of the trade strategy

505
00:28:01,710 --> 00:28:04,232
of a position, a delta position unwind.

